From ub756a7daa2c2aa6d at groups.google.com  Mon Apr  8 14:03:16 2013
From: ub756a7daa2c2aa6d at groups.google.com (Hadley Wickham)
Date: Mon, 08 Apr 2013 14:03:16 +0000
Subject: Re: when is an expression evaluated in ggplot2 ?
Message-ID: <JvGZddwcO2g.T5buobu9-9MJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <JvGZddwcO2g.eQ3FFIJ53DUJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
References: <JvGZddwcO2g.eQ3FFIJ53DUJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
