Subject: ggmap 2.3 released
Message-ID: <GqjXOoy_FtI.ZGhMfoDIG6wJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/GqjXOoy_FtI/m/ZGhMfoDIG6wJ>
