I would create the grouping variable outside of ggplot, then pass the
group argument to aes_string, like this:

d[["gl"]] <- interaction(d[["g"]], d[["l"]])

ggplot(d) + geom_line(aes_string(group="gl", x="x", y="y", color="g",
linetype="l"))

Best,
Ista

