Subject: Re: Change stacked bar ordering with a variable
Message-ID: <Zhhq4WzbmsI.kw8kV1b4HSwJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Zhhq4WzbmsI.6keXY1-iu5oJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
